00:53:27.120 --> 00:53:29.831
Make who stop? Who. Clay?
Who are you talking about?

755
00:53:29.998 --> 00:53:32.375
- There are two kinds of death.
- Clay!

756
00:53:32.626 --> 00:53:34.502
If you're not lucky.
you die a little bit...

757
00:53:34.586 --> 00:53:37.005
- Clay. come on.
- ...over and over.

758
00:53:37.255 --> 00:53:38.882
until you realize it's too late.

759
00:53:39.174 --> 00:53:41.176
Just stop. Give me the gun.

760
00:53:49.017 --> 00:53:50.435
What the fuck?

761
00:53:59.945 --> 00:54:01.696
And in that moment. it felt...

762
00:54:04.407 --> 00:54:06.451
it felt like I was already dead.

763
00:54:33.228 --> 00:54:35.230
For help finding crisis resources.

764
00:54:35.313 --> 00:54:37.524
visit 13reasonswhy.info.

765
00:56:58.873 --> 00:57:00.750
Well done. Ed. Well done.
